  "section": "105",
  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "Section 105(1) of the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006 prohibits landlords from collecting any security deposit other than a lawful rent deposit. Because a damage deposit is not a rent deposit, the clause conflicts with the Act and is void under section 4(1)."
}

